    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394540/extras/740c21496c063b602c144693904a9785.avif?t=1754931085\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forever Lost In A Maze...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >following your boss around different cities across the UK, from silly goofy Train Stations to the iconic F1 track, collect different items like a totally-not-phallic sausage for JoshGeoff, your ring leader boss. What will happen if you don't get these items... you don't want to know since it'll be your worst, and last nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JoshGeoff Weiner Simulator Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment, we have 5 maps available during Early Access, with more to come in the future leading up to Full Release! The current 5 maps include, Weiner Town, Kiev Central, Silverstone, Bus Station and Bike Depot... with our 6th map 'Strawb Street' in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394540/extras/69705efd9b96d060dc8f14a06069f1c4.avif?t=1754931085\" data-has-big width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forever Lost In A Maze...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >following your boss around different cities across the UK, from silly goofy Train Stations to the iconic F1 track, collect different items like a totally-not-phallic sausage for JoshGeoff, your ring leader boss. What will happen if you don't get these items... you don't want to know since it'll be your worst, and last nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JoshGeoff Weiner Simulator Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment, we have 5 maps available during Early Access, with more to come in the future leading up to Full Release! The current 5 maps include, Weiner Town, Kiev Central, Silverstone, Bus Station and Bike Depot... with our 6th map 'Strawb Street' in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394540/extras/69705efd9b96d060dc8f14a06069f1c4.avif?t=1754931085\" data-has-big width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
